1
00:00:00,200 --> 00:00:06,128
Writing, task two. E-mail number 19: Booking a cleaning.

2
00:00:06,967 --> 00:00:16,055
You want to book a cleaning company. Write them an e-mail. Write an e-mail of at least thirty-five words. Write one sentence for each picture.

3
00:00:24,900 --> 00:00:26,099
Good afternoon,

4
00:00:26,333 --> 00:00:28,238
I would like to book a cleaning of my flat.

5
00:00:28,500 --> 00:00:31,476
The flat is 3+1 (three rooms and a kitchen), about 75 square metres.

6
00:00:31,733 --> 00:00:36,094
I need the windows washed, the carpets vacuumed and the kitchen and bathroom cleaned.

7
00:00:36,333 --> 00:00:39,152
Please come on Friday 20 March in the morning.

8
00:00:39,400 --> 00:00:42,977
I'll be at work; I'll leave the key for you with my neighbour on the first floor.

9
00:00:43,233 --> 00:00:45,034
I'll pay by bank transfer.

10
00:00:45,300 --> 00:00:52,481
This e-mail has 52 words. There is one sentence for each picture. Don't forget the greeting at the beginning and the end.

11
00:00:53,533 --> 00:01:01,890
Write your own e-mail on the Zkouška A2 nanečisto website, the link is in the video description. And subscribe — a new video every day.
